# Threaded WASM needs cross-origin isolation on every page.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp

# The tree library must stay outside isolation: the tabEE send buttons need a
# live handle on the receiving window, and the page loads the MicrobeTrace SDK.
# Later rules detach headers added above.
/trees.html
  ! Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy
  ! Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy
